  "prefLabel": "Emp 409.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 409.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to address the requirements for offset of tax refund payments against unpaid benefit overpayments pursuant to 31 C.F.R. 285.8 and proper criteria for forbearance.\n\nSource. #10424, eff 9-27-13; ss by #13965, eff 5-16-24",
